## 4. Data Input Methods

### File & Directory Monitoring
```ini
# inputs.conf
[monitor:///var/log/syslog]
disabled = false
sourcetype = syslog
index = os_logs

[monitor:///var/log/apache2/access.log]
disabled = false
sourcetype = access_combined
index = web_logs
```

### Network Inputs (TCP/UDP)
```ini
# inputs.conf — receive syslog on UDP 514
[udp://514]
sourcetype = syslog
index = network_logs

# TCP input on port 5514
[tcp://5514]
sourcetype = custom_tcp
index = custom_index
```

### Scripted Inputs
```ini
# inputs.conf — run a script every 60 seconds
[script:///opt/splunk/etc/apps/myapp/bin/my_script.sh]
interval = 60
